NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE
========================

Two sets of files in this repository carry their own terms, and the MIT grant
above does not extend to them.

1. The DSO catalogue data — `data/dso_catalog_extended.json` and
   `data/dso_aliases.json` — is adapted from OpenNGC (© Mattia Verga) and is
   licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Its share-alike condition binds those two files and
   anything adapted from them; it does NOT bind the application code, which is
   MIT as above. Required attribution, the full list of modifications, and the
   Sharpless/Lynds citations for the two manually-added objects are in
   `data/ATTRIBUTION-OpenNGC.md`, which must travel with the data.

2. IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono, self-hosted under `web/public/fonts/`, are
   licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. See the `LICENSE.txt` beside
   each family's files.

Sky-survey imagery fetched at runtime (DSS2, via CDS hips2fits) is not
redistributed in this repository, but its required acknowledgment is recorded
in `docs/ATTRIBUTION-DSS.md` for anyone publishing images obtained through it.
